{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#card-zh","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer 是面向 DSH 网页端的界面插件，在每个会话标题栏加入宽度按钮，点击即可循环切换七档聊天列宽。插件覆盖聊天内容区和输入框宽度，并放宽用户消息气泡的宽度限制；所选宽度在会话间共享，也会保存到浏览器本地以便刷新后恢复。窗口较窄时会按视口限制实际宽度，跨标签页修改可同步。适合希望在网页会话中调整阅读与编写空间的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:118-133","lib/client.js:172-175"]}
{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#card-en","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer adds a session header button to DSH web. Cycle seven presets to widen the conversation, composer, and user bubbles. Width is shared across sessions, saved locally, synced across tabs, and clamped for narrow screens. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:118-133","lib/client.js:172-175"]}
