{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#feature-1","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer 的功能「聊天宽度预设」：在会话标题栏点击宽度按钮，循环切换 748 至 1600 像素的七档预设，并同步更新聊天列、输入框和用户消息气泡。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:27-30"]}
{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#feature-2","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer 的功能「宽度跨会话共享」：每个会话标题栏的按钮共享模块级宽度状态；在一个会话选择的宽度会反映到其他会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:78-83"]}
{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#feature-3","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer 的功能「保存并恢复宽度」：选择的预设写入浏览器 localStorage，页面重新加载时读取有效值；无效或不可读时回到默认预设。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:52-64"]}
{"unit_id":"magicOF2__dsh-chat-width-customizer#feature-4","repo":"magicOF2/dsh-chat-width-customizer","commit":"de11dccb6e6321185274b0fd34d5a8aa0ffebf90","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Chat Width Customizer 的功能「视口适配与标签页同步」：窗口变化时重新限制实际宽度以适配视口；其他标签页修改宽度后，通过 storage 事件同步当前页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:149-163"]}
